; cmake_roundtrip: tree-sitter CST JSON on stdin -> reprinted cmake.
; print2.exe walks the Stage-1 untyped AST, dispatches each Cmd to a
; per-command parser producing Lang_cmake.exp, and reprints via
; Lang_cmake_pp. Commands without a typed parser flow through
; Apply { name; args } which untyped_emit reprints verbatim.
(executables
 (names print2 project_index cache_vars)
 (libraries base yojson yelu_langs unix))
